        <name>queue</name>
        <briefdescription>
<para>Queue of limbo entries. </para>        </briefdescription>
        <detaileddescription>
<para>Ordered by LSN. Some of the entries in the end may not have an LSN yet (their local WAL write is still in progress), but their order won&apos;t change anyway. Because WAL write completions will give them LSNs in the same order. </para>        </detaileddescription>
